    "title": "UPDATED: Death investigation underway at park in Old Town - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Emily Leayman ,\n6 hours ago Police responded to Windmill Hill Park in Old Town for a death investigation this evening (Wednesday), according to the Alexandria Police Department. Just before 4:30 p.m., police were called to the area of S. Union and Wilkes Street for a reported suicide, according to police radio dispatches. Police said there was a heavy police presence at the park, and there is no public safety concern. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
